0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","$L2",null,{"project":{"slug":"jack-daniels","title":"Jack Daniels","category":null,"thumbnail":"/images/work/jack-daniels/thumb.jpg","summary":"Jack Daniels is a premiere brand of Tennessee whiskey that really needs no introduction. The name has been synonymous with its one-of-a-kind taste that’s unmistakably Jack. A recent addition to the Jack Daniels line, Jack Daniels Honey, required a special touch to attract the youth market they desired.","images":["/images/work/jack-daniels/img-1.jpg"],"videoUrl":null,"blocks":[{"type":"full-image","image":"/images/work/jack-daniels/img-2.jpg","imageWidth":2000,"imageHeight":1335,"alt":"Jack Daniels Honey \"Sweet for the Soul\" subway billboard"},{"type":"text-row","heading":"Approach","reverse":true,"text":"Capturing the vibe of a venue serving this particular product was necessary for this promotion. We shot live footage of a Jack Daniels Honey promotional event in Hollywood, California. This allowed us to engage the spontaneous energy of the event."},{"type":"full-image","image":"/images/work/jack-daniels/img-3.jpg","imageWidth":1600,"imageHeight":2398,"alt":"Jack Daniels Honey promotional event billboard"},{"type":"text-row","heading":"Production","text":"The Hollywood SupperClub became the perfect venue for this production. We seeded the crowd of regular patrons with a few actors to keep the vibe lively. The result was an event that captured the youth and exuberance necessary for the launch of this new Gen X product."},{"type":"video-embed","variant":"ambient","src":"https://player.vimeo.com/video/720933304?api=1&background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&title=0&byline=0&portrait=0"}]}}],["$","$L3",null,{"project":"$0:rsc:props:children:0:0:props:project"}]],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/1y7u-8e-s3dda.js","async":true}]],["$","$L4",null,{"children":["$","$5",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@6"}]}]]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":nu